{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14307","headline":"酬谢韦卿二十五兄俯赠輙敢书情 · 窦庠","name":"酬谢韦卿二十五兄俯赠輙敢书情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大贤持赠一明璫，蓬荜初惊满室光。\n埋没剑中生紫气，尘埃瑟上动清商。\n荆山璞在终应识，楚国人知不是狂。\n莫恨伏辕身未老，会将筋力是王良。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦庠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}